n&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arthom_the_Hunter_aba02c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Arthom The Hunter.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He's the boss of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> and Poachers in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter%20Camp\">Hunter Camp</a>, but also seems to be a researcher studying the culture of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworcs\">Dworcs</a>. While at first the man-eating Dworcs seemed rather passive towards them and everything was going as planned, things soon turned grim. After the young and inexperienced members of the group Jenkinson and Abrams first managed to be infected by a strange toxin, the Dworcs also suddenly turned on them. They ended up being gorily sacrificed and eaten before his eyes after dying a painful death from the poison. He wrote those experiences down in his notes, and from these it actually appears that he eventually died himself too. Here he is, however, very much alive.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:139px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Arthom_the_hunter-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:137px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arthom_the_hunter_ae44a4.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Arthom the hunter.png (3.9 MB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Shoots <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrows</a></span> (0-150)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Arthom the Hunter</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211085942&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arthom_the_Hunter_aba02c.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"500\" data-vert=\"500\" style=\"width:500%;height:500%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20180831165608&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arrow_Missile_62a93e.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<